<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
  <meta name="description" content="Data visualizations about heat-related deaths and projected extreme heat events in Maryland.">
  <meta name="author" content="Kai Mathis">
  <title>Heat in Maryland | Kai Mathis</title>

  <!-- Bootstrap 4 -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.6.2/css/bootstrap.min.css">

  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #172733;
      --muted: #53636d;
      --accent: #c7442f;
      --rule: #d9e0e3;
      --paper: #fff;
      --wash: #f4f7f8;
    }

    body {
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--wash);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    .navbar,
    footer {
      background: #12384a;
    }

    .navbar-brand,
    .navbar-text {
      color: #fff !important;
    }

    .page-header {
      padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 850px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
      font-weight: 750;
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .dek {
      max-width: 760px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    main {
      padding: 2rem 0 3.5rem;
    }

    .graphic-card {
      height: 100%;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--rule);
      border-top: 4px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: .25rem;
      box-shadow: 0 .25rem 1rem rgba(23, 39, 51, .05);
    }

    .graphic-card h2 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .source {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .88rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 1.25rem 0;
      color: #dce7eb;
      font-size: .9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
      .page-header {
        padding: 2.25rem 0 1.5rem;
      }

      .graphic-card {
        padding: 1rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <nav class="navbar navbar-expand navbar-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="navbar-brand font-weight-bold" href="#top">MARYLAND | EXTREME HEAT</a>
      <span class="navbar-text d-none d-sm-inline">Data visualizations</span>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="page-header" id="top">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-2">Heat and public health</p>
      <h1 class="mb-3">Maryland’s heat burden, by place and year</h1>
      <p class="dek mb-0">
        Heat-related deaths have affected communities across Maryland. The
        graphics below compare annual death counts in Baltimore and Maryland
        and show projected extreme heat events by county in 2040.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <section class="col-12 mb-4" aria-labelledby="deaths-title">
          <article class="graphic-card">
            <p class="eyebrow mb-2">01 · Heat-related deaths</p>
            <h2 id="deaths-title">
              Baltimore has more than its share of heat-related deaths in Maryland
            </h2>
            <p class="text-muted">
              Each year has one bar for Baltimore and one for Maryland.
            </p>

            <div style="min-height:540px" id="datawrapper-vis-NwheM">
              <script
                type="text/javascript"
                defer
                src="https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/NwheM/embed.js"
                charset="utf-8"
                data-target="#datawrapper-vis-NwheM">
              </script>
              <noscript>
                <img
                  src="https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/NwheM/full.png"
                  alt="Hot weather deaths in Baltimore and Maryland by year (Bar Chart)">
              </noscript>
            </div>

            <p class="source mb-0">Source: Maryland Department of Health.</p>
          </article>
        </section>

        <section class="col-12" aria-labelledby="map-title">
          <article class="graphic-card">
            <p class="eyebrow mb-2">02 · County projections</p>
            <h2 id="map-title">
              Projected number of extreme heat events in Maryland for the year 2040
            </h2>
            <p class="text-muted">
              The projected county values range from about 40 to 70 extreme heat events.
            </p>

            <div style="min-height:450px" id="datawrapper-vis-QQLFK">
              <script
                type="text/javascript"
                defer
                src="https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/QQLFK/embed.js"
                charset="utf-8"
                data-target="#datawrapper-vis-QQLFK">
              </script>
              <noscript>
                <img
                  src="https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/QQLFK/full.png"
                  alt="Projected number of extreme heat events in Maryland for the year 2040 (Choropleth map)">
              </noscript>
            </div>

            <p class="source mb-0">Sources: Maryland Climate and Health Report.</p>
          </article>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">Created by Kai Mathis · Datawrapper · Bootstrap 4</div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
